      "id": 5,
      "claim": "Because the skull is larger than the canal and cannot be deformed enough without fracturing, an intact adult skull cannot pass through the birth canal.",
      "evidence": "Logical combination of steps 3 (size mismatch) and 4 (lack of deformability).",
